WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.601 --> 00:00:03.033
-Welcome back. We're hanging out
with Kevin Hart right here,

00:00:03.033 --> 00:00:04.801
the one and only!

00:00:04.801 --> 00:00:06.367
Kevin Hart.

00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:08.701
You're back
with Dwayne Johnson...

00:00:08.701 --> 00:00:11.033
-Yes.
-in "DC League of Super-Pets."

00:00:11.033 --> 00:00:13.434
Animated. Super-big movie.
It's out this Friday.

00:00:13.434 --> 00:00:15.267
You guys are always great
together.

00:00:15.267 --> 00:00:17.033
When did you know that you guys
were gonna be --

00:00:17.033 --> 00:00:19.100
I mean, you guys are
in the history books together.

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:21.200
-You know what, man?
We -- We really --

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:23.601
We really do get along.

00:00:23.601 --> 00:00:27.267
Like, it's a good relationship.
It's a genuine relationship.

00:00:27.267 --> 00:00:29.767
And it was something
that we stumbled upon, right?

00:00:29.767 --> 00:00:31.434
Like, we did our first movie
together,

00:00:31.434 --> 00:00:35.601
and the conversations grew,
the friendship grew,

00:00:35.601 --> 00:00:37.467
but it grew because
we were around each other.

00:00:37.467 --> 00:00:39.934
Like, in between takes, we
weren't running to the trailer.

00:00:39.934 --> 00:00:42.901
We were sitting, talking,
getting to know each other.

00:00:42.901 --> 00:00:45.334
And we found that the scenes
became better

00:00:45.334 --> 00:00:48.901
as we became closer, so we
kind of held onto that dynamic,

00:00:48.901 --> 00:00:51.367
and it only progressed
as time went on.

00:00:51.367 --> 00:00:53.501
-It's funny to watch you guys
even just do an interview,

00:00:53.501 --> 00:00:56.434
and someone will say something
about the other person...

00:00:56.434 --> 00:00:58.334
I mean, you can't mess
with Kevin Hart

00:00:58.334 --> 00:01:00.167
if you're going to try to
outrank somebody.

00:01:00.167 --> 00:01:03.467
But -- But he tries.
-He does all the time.

00:01:03.467 --> 00:01:05.234
-Yeah, he does.
-He's not the smartest person.

00:01:05.234 --> 00:01:08.200
He's not. He's not.
He's a genuine guy.

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:11.000
-Oh, my God. "A genuine guy."
-Genuine guy. Yeah.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:12.400
-Yeah, no, I would say
he's pretty smart.

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:14.434
-He's not the brightest bulb
in the box.

00:01:14.434 --> 00:01:16.033
-Oh, my God.

00:01:16.033 --> 00:01:17.501
But that's what you guys do.
-Yes.

00:01:17.501 --> 00:01:20.033
-And then -- But someone said --
They go, "You know, it's funny.

00:01:20.033 --> 00:01:22.400
You play ping-pong with Kevin,
and you're like --

00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:24.367
Oh, and he said
some mean stuff to you.

00:01:24.367 --> 00:01:26.667
And then he'll just say
one nice, really..."

00:01:26.667 --> 00:01:28.000
-One thing. One nice thing.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:30.801
-"And you'll go,
'Oh, I love that dude.'"

00:01:30.801 --> 00:01:32.467
-It's a Jedi.
The Jedi mind trick.

00:01:32.467 --> 00:01:34.167
The Jedi mind trick,
all the time.

00:01:34.167 --> 00:01:36.267
-So you guys did
the tortilla slap challenge.

00:01:36.267 --> 00:01:37.934
-Yeah!
-I was afraid for you, Kevin.

00:01:37.934 --> 00:01:39.167
-I slapped the [bleep]
out of him. Did you see it?

00:01:39.167 --> 00:01:41.400
-No! No, no, no, no.
I was afraid for you.

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:42.634
-Oh. Oh, my God.

00:01:42.634 --> 00:01:44.501
-Kevin Hart, I was afraid
for you, because I go --

00:01:44.501 --> 00:01:46.367
'Cause you're -- you're ready to
do it, and then you're holding

00:01:46.367 --> 00:01:48.434
the tortilla -- and if you
haven't seen it on TikTok,

00:01:48.434 --> 00:01:50.601
you take a tortilla,
you drink a sip of water,

00:01:50.601 --> 00:01:52.601
and you slap a tortilla
across someone's face.

00:01:52.601 --> 00:01:55.300
-Yes.
-Dwayne's hand was behind this.

00:01:55.300 --> 00:01:57.133
-Yeah, I had to make sure
he was holding it right.

00:01:57.133 --> 00:01:58.968
-Yeah, 'cause he was holding --
He was gonna do this.

00:01:58.968 --> 00:02:00.601
-No, I think he was gonna
try to smack --

00:02:00.601 --> 00:02:03.434
I honestly think --
I think he wanted to kill me.

00:02:03.434 --> 00:02:05.300
And I'm just being honest,
right?

00:02:05.300 --> 00:02:08.434
Because he had his -- he had his
whole palm behind the tortilla.

00:02:08.434 --> 00:02:10.067
I'm like, "No. No!
hat's not how you do it!"

00:02:10.067 --> 00:02:11.467
-That's not
tortilla slap challenge.

00:02:11.467 --> 00:02:13.267
-That's not the slap.
-You slap with the tortilla.

00:02:13.267 --> 00:02:14.868
"You're just gonna slap me."

00:02:14.868 --> 00:02:16.434
-And then he's like --
[Grunting]

00:02:16.434 --> 00:02:17.734
'Cause that's how he talks.

00:02:17.734 --> 00:02:20.834
[Grunting]

00:02:20.834 --> 00:02:22.667
-Alright. Yeah. This is --

00:02:22.667 --> 00:02:24.701
-[Grunting]

00:02:24.701 --> 00:02:26.634
-Now it's like Schwarzenegger.
What are you doing?

00:02:26.634 --> 00:02:29.000
-[Grunting]
-Alright. Here -- This is --

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:30.834
This is you slapping Dwayne...

00:02:30.834 --> 00:02:32.734
-Yeah.
-...with a tortilla.

00:02:32.734 --> 00:02:34.634
-Yeah, you can't even --
The photo isn't even good,

00:02:34.634 --> 00:02:36.567
'cause that's how fast I was
when I did it.

00:02:36.567 --> 00:02:38.467
You know why I hit him so fast?
-Why?

00:02:38.467 --> 00:02:40.968
-'Cause I felt like I had to
get out of there afterward.

00:02:40.968 --> 00:02:43.734
[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.734 --> 00:02:45.834
-This is him slapping you.
Look at his face.

00:02:45.834 --> 00:02:48.634
-Yeah, no, look.
He's so -- I'm telling you!

00:02:48.634 --> 00:02:50.167
I'm telling you, he's so evil.

00:02:50.167 --> 00:02:52.601
Like, he's really --
Sometimes I think --

00:02:52.601 --> 00:02:54.601
Sometimes I think
he wants to hurt me, man.

00:02:54.601 --> 00:02:56.701
-Yeah, he wanted to draw blood.
-Yeah, like, that's --

00:02:56.701 --> 00:02:58.667
Why is he --
Like, why is he like that?!

00:02:58.667 --> 00:03:02.367
I've never seen --
I've never seen this photo.

00:03:02.367 --> 00:03:05.734
-He got mad at you.
-This -- Look at this face!

00:03:05.734 --> 00:03:08.067
-It's a tortilla --
It's a tortilla slap challenge.

00:03:08.067 --> 00:03:09.434
-No!
-You don't make that face

00:03:09.434 --> 00:03:10.968
when you slap someone
with a tortilla.

00:03:10.968 --> 00:03:13.834
-He's biting down on his teeth.
Look!

00:03:13.834 --> 00:03:17.234
You don't do that unless you
have real hate for somebody.

00:03:17.234 --> 00:03:18.601
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.601 --> 00:03:20.801
I gotta call him about this.

00:03:20.801 --> 00:03:22.767
-Yeah. Right? Yeah.

00:03:22.767 --> 00:03:25.200
The movie's great.
It's good for kids.

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:27.133
-It really is.
-Great for adults, as well.

00:03:27.133 --> 00:03:29.501
But, I mean, it's all DC,
all the superheroes, but pets.

00:03:29.501 --> 00:03:31.133
-Yes.
-It's awesome, and it's funny.

00:03:31.133 --> 00:03:32.667
I want to show everyone a clip.

00:03:32.667 --> 00:03:33.834
-Here's Kevin Hart
and Dwayne Johnson

00:03:33.834 --> 00:03:35.434
in "DC League of Super-Pets."

00:03:35.434 --> 00:03:37.133
Take a look.

00:03:37.133 --> 00:03:40.634
-Ha! Did you -- Ha ha ha!
You don't have your powers.

00:03:40.634 --> 00:03:42.200
You're just trying
to use us now

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:43.934
'cause you can't
handle it on your own.

00:03:43.934 --> 00:03:45.801
-I know these powers
are new to you,

00:03:45.801 --> 00:03:47.801
but when one has
an abundance of power,

00:03:47.801 --> 00:03:50.667
they have a certain duty
to use that power to...

00:03:50.667 --> 00:03:52.601
[ Urinating ]

00:03:54.634 --> 00:03:56.801
-Sorry.
You were saying something?

00:03:56.801 --> 00:03:59.767
-I was making
an inspiring hero speech.

00:03:59.767 --> 00:04:03.300
[ Urinating ]

00:04:03.300 --> 00:04:05.167
How much did you have to drink?

00:04:05.167 --> 00:04:06.834
-I had two toilet bowls
and a bidet.

00:04:06.834 --> 00:04:08.601
Bidet, too, which is --
which is crazy.

00:04:08.601 --> 00:04:10.267
I didn't even know
that was a thing,

00:04:10.267 --> 00:04:12.100
but it's like
a dog water fountain.

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:14.167
-You disgusting animal.

00:04:14.167 --> 00:04:16.701
-Pack, let's roll out.
I'll see you never.

00:04:16.701 --> 00:04:19.634
-Yeah. "I had two toilet bowls
and a bidet."

00:04:19.634 --> 00:04:22.033
-"And a bidet."
-Kevin Hart, everybody.

00:04:22.033 --> 00:04:26.567
"DC League of Super-Pets"
is in theaters Friday.

00:04:26.567 --> 00:04:29.934
Check out "Me Time" on Netflix,
